      "id": "claim_57e76f9c50324674a10f45fe726d2873",
      "statement": "Agent-facing conversation tools obtain trusted invocation scope rather than model-supplied scope, constrain pages to 1–20 entries, and translate scan-limit failures into tool errors; complete archive traversal refuses a page after 500 records rather than pretending it is complete.",
