      "id": "claim_c8237988ae1a40359936b2b91fd5c235",
      "statement": "Optional vector search runs as a durable background worker that writes vectors before acknowledging rows, retries indexing errors without stopping conversation writes, applies a two-second semantic-search deadline, and falls back to keyword search on timeout or error.",
