      "statement": "Vector indexes are fingerprint generation-scoped; an incompatible existing fingerprint or interrupted reindex blocks startup unless explicit reindexing is enabled, in which case Talon durably erases old vectors, resets indexing progress, and rebuilds from retained transcripts with a restartable cursor.",
